<title>HONG KONG: Morgan sets warrants on China Overseas.</title>
<headline>Morgan sets warrants on China Overseas.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it launched on Thursday 810 million American-style warrants on shares of China Overseas Land &amp; Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$2.7675	 PREMIUM	     11.95 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.0675	 GEARING	     4.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	9.OCT.97	  SETTLEMENT DATE   28.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	 MIN EXER LOT	20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$3.075	  LISTING DATE	31.OCT.96</p>
<p>NOTES  GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
